# Normalize all text files to LF.
#
# Written 2026-08-15, when the repository did have a CRLF/LF mix, and it
# said so ("e.g. docs/CHANGELOG-DESIGN.md, adr/README.md ... existing
# files are not rewritten by this alone"). Those files have been LF in
# the index for some time; corrected 2026-08-21 after an audit found the
# comment still describing the old state. Verified with
# `git ls-files --eol`: every tracked text file is `i/lf`, and the only
# non-LF entries are the eleven empty `planning/**.yaml` files, which
# report `i/none` because they have no content at all.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: do not attempt line-ending normalization
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
